, with a system-wide tool that can read the selection and type back into the field. Built-in OS features vary by version and app. VoiceOS Edit mode is available on Mac and Windows for this loop.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will voice editing send my email automatically?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It should not. A rewrite only changes text in the field. Sending is a separate action. In VoiceOS, Agent actions that message or schedule use a confirmation step before anything consequential goes out; Edit mode is for the text itself.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if I only want grammar fixes, not a full rewrite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Say so explicitly: \\\"Fix grammar and punctuation. Do not change the meaning or tone.\\\" Vague prompts invite bigger rewrites than you asked for.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does this help with RSI or carpal tunnel?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Reducing retyping can lower keyboard load for many people. It is a workflow aid, not a diagnosis or cure. Combine it with breaks, setup changes, and professional care when needed.\"}}]}]}6:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#F9F9F9\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 md:px-6 pt-32 md:pt-44 pb-16 md:pb-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto lg:grid lg:gap-10 lg:[grid-template-columns:220px_minmax(0,1fr)_60px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden lg:block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-32\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-[#eee] bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#666]\",\"chil